# Optional overrides for running the engine from source (`make backend-dev`).
#
# The desktop app needs none of this: it starts its own engine and passes the
# database path and data directory itself. When you run the backend by hand,
# the engine reads `.env` from its working directory, so copy this file to
# src/backend/.env and uncomment what you need. Every value has a default.
# Full reference: docs/configuration.md

# ---- App ----
# JWT signing key (openssl rand -hex 32)
# POLARIS_SECRET_KEY=change-me-random-64-chars
# SSH credential encryption. Leave unset to derive a key from the secret key;
# never leave a placeholder here, it is not a valid Fernet key.
# (python -c "from cryptography.fernet import Fernet;print(Fernet.generate_key().decode())")
# POLARIS_ENCRYPTION_KEY=

# ---- Storage ----
# SQLite database (the only supported database) and the directory for PDFs,
# exports and other files. Relative paths resolve against the working directory.
# POLARIS_DATABASE_URL=sqlite+aiosqlite:///./polaris_dev.db
# POLARIS_DATA_DIR=./data

# ---- Models ----
# Agent backends (Claude Code, Codex, ...) and model APIs are set up in the app
# under Settings -> Models & agents and stored in the database. This is only the
# fallback base URL for OpenAI-compatible routes that leave base_url empty.
# POLARIS_OPENAI_COMPAT_BASE_URL=https://api.deepseek.com/v1
# Fall back to the built-in fake provider when no model is configured
# (tests / key-less demos only, off by default).
# POLARIS_LLM_FAKE_FALLBACK=1
# Turn on the assistant's multi-turn tool loop.
# POLARIS_CHAT_AGENT_ENABLED=1

# ---- Literature APIs ----
# Semantic Scholar (optional; rate limits are tighter without a key)
# POLARIS_S2_API_KEY=
# Venue metrics use OpenAlex anonymously by default. EasyScholar is optional.
# POLARIS_EASYSCHOLAR_SECRET_KEYS=
# Outbound proxy for literature APIs, when arXiv/S2/OpenAlex are unreliable
# directly. Model and intranet traffic does not go through it.
# POLARIS_OUTBOUND_PROXY=http://127.0.0.1:7897

# ---- MCP links ----
# Server root used only by stdio MCP download links. HTTP MCP always reuses
# the origin of the current /mcp request.
# POLARIS_PUBLIC_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8000
